<section id="about" class="bg-[var(--color-ink)] text-[var(--color-paper)]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-12 items-start">

      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--color-accent-soft)] mb-4">About</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
          Ligen.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Building applied AI workflows for finance and investment research.
          Currently based in the UAE — open to AI-for-finance roles across the MENA region.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">What I do</h3>
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
            I package the methodological discipline of investment research — source provenance,
            three-state labeling (fact / estimate / inference), unit-consistency checks, multi-source
            triangulation — as composable AI workflows. Each workflow is proven with a real end-to-end
            deliverable before it's open-sourced.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Why MENA, why now</h3>
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
            The region is in the middle of a once-in-a-generation rewiring: sovereign-wealth-led
            industrial policy, AI as a strategic vertical (PIF's Humain, MGX, G42), capital markets
            deepening. Applied AI talent meets domain depth most usefully <em>inside</em> the institutions
            building it, not from a distance. I want to be in that room.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Working principles</h3>
          <ul class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
            <li><strong class="text-white">Ship the artifact, not the prototype.</strong> Every workflow gets a full deliverable before it's called done.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">No fabricated numbers.</strong> "Not publicly available" beats a plausible guess. Always.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">AI is the copilot.</strong> The hypothesis, the scope, the final sign-off — all human.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
